# Handle line endings automatically for files detected as text
# and leave all files detected as binary untouched.
*	text=auto

# 上游补丁与原始快照必须保持字节原样：一旦被自动转成 CRLF，`git apply` 会因上下文失配而失败
docs/upstream-patches/**/*.patch	-text
docs/upstream-patches/**/*.orig	-text
